			(property "Description" "CUSTOM HF power transformer (COLD-PLATE MOUNTED), N1:N2 = 11:12 (n 0.9167); L_sigma 4.38 uH +/-20 % (design target, referred to N1); L_m 150 uH +/-10 % (gapped, ~1.74 mm total); 4.75 mVs per half period, B_pk 126 mT at 950 V; I_rms 118.5 / 111.9 A, I_pk 176.9 / 162.1 A (prim / sec); loss <= 159 W; hot spot <= 130 C (coolant 50 C); insulation basic (pending system decision), working-voltage basis 1850 V DC, PD <= 10 pC at the ECO-10 level (hipot/PD: TBD by ECO-10 insulation coordination); reference core TDK PM 114/93 N95 (B65733A0000R095 ground to gap) + bobbin B65734B1000T001 - reference only; embedded NTC 10 k +/-2 %, R/T 8016 (B25/100 3988 K, as TDK B57703M0103) at the winding hot spot, leads TH1/TH2 reinforced to PELV. Full RFQ: sim/out/dab_design/report.md sec. 9"
				(at 0 -19.05 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
