	)
	(text "P1/S1 = dotted ends. Secondary: leg A of bridge 2 - HOB - S1 / S2 - leg B of bridge 2. TH1/TH2: embedded\nNTC -> bridge 1 AN3. L_sigma 4.38 uH +/-20 %, L_m 150 uH +/-10 %, 119 / 112 A rms, 177 / 162 A peak, <= 159 W,\nhot spot <= 130 C. Insulation basic (pending system decision) on a 1850 V DC working basis; hipot/PD from ECO-10, PD <= 10 pC.\nFull text in the part description and report.md sec. 9."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.7 64.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6e49a8c0-37a4-5285-8206-b8f3b24dea02")
	)
	(text "Link FITTED. Provision: unbolt it and fit the blocking bank 5 x C4AQUEW5450A3BJ (225 uF) (DNP below, 225 uF).\nFirmware flux-balance loop on AN1 + gapped core (L_m 150 uH) + hardware |I_dc| trip is the baseline.\nSeries L (CUSTOM): 2.12 uH nominal, trimmed 1.24-2.99 uH so that leakage + L = 6.50 uH +/-5 % (leakage + external, measured as a matched set);\n119 A rms, 177 A peak, no saturation to 275 A, <= 11 W."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 82.2523 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a9f19abc-29f6-5f63-82ca-8044888d7615")
	)
